{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 587,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c32f3935b2116a474c93f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你高兴就好……不管是否受人期待，\\n我的跑法都不会变就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c51b5babc265a6ebf4c68019cb90d2d785bb5c7146387306a9ce7558afa3e25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "280"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039d3d21aab1ff3e2a75b97f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是的。而且还是在刚起床的时候。\\n我当时真的不知道该做出什么反应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "713f8f9bbec3fe2b05f9d230aa48e8c4b6d8daa66f60d569e54841c10de17f55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec33cb7456745c8916bac40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………运气。\\n我现在之所以还在跑也全是因为如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc8d9dbed6953ec2003475d95188628081f2288115ec1364bcb60e3e93e9107",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "282"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c83c055629e25bbe7af25d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会跑出令大家着迷的竞赛。\\n拜托大家给我连太阳公公都听得见的声援啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5855b820e9bf42bea01685ad5725b91f60b881579e7d040099c3b948f5ef857",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "283"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3cc0cc96d7056a8116cc205",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去澡堂泡热水澡！然后回去时穿着木屐，\\n「咖答咖答」地走去神社祈祷胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "943e0e3a4a375f498c007302e09666df18b3b18d291db546eb2ba118708e62c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "284"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b9eeb25981fe9a4fc843e10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一边躺在榻榻米上一边喝浓～浓的茶！\\n这样最赞了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1c5b07b5eed19887a4c3cdaf83d8060cdc2f5771997ab08af628ab8ff88073a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "285"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d80309ada6640ece95853d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尽全力玩耍！像是打篮球、棒球、\\n玩鬼抓人，还有其他各种游戏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc5f34db12b27feca31a0c940a657d39a1fa57fd7740b327d47b3f3d885f4486",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "286"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae7a9c67ea0a1b3565bcae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尽全力较劲！即使对手是朋友\\n也绝对不会放水喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a92a46772c21aa34e5623f3837ee6285563a769c09e0586766c08882b55e1ac4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "287"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c94b6821f304da499ebc911",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在桑拿比忍耐力！不过等我清醒时已经躺在\\n床上了呢。咦？那个算训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "483a3af372d226f8e4768a9d30bf1b9c8527107eef202a7f6a27a37fe319574b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "288"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b8011039f50036c37c757d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啥？给我闭上嘴看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f03b300faef7775b77f8a86e18f832b447c670ef8bed0e62b27391008892905",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1b7e354b22f75e188b20c62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会静坐让mind平静！\\nBeauty中不足的是会想睡觉呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0c525859eae9db6cf39a369e2f9cfd2de68ec82c4bdcf0a7284dcd364b0ca4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5acfa01a8953a5fbb66b486c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊……忘记那是什么营养补充品了，\\n啥？营养补充品不算餐点？少啰嗦啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8454cc01f074d9d7e32ca2184e2da95162e72d790490eb90dcaed34b8f4a2830",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "290"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6379cd0ae5e2b5cb51f9bf09",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……想挑衅我？如果有的话，\\n大概是能否遇上有骨气的对手吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d880009e86ae70cd6f7616cf8ffc62774fc64bd0e2036a55c690108491dab6a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a78ad25afbb0f4895952c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "制定缜密的计划，\\n并且照预定计划去完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ffca90716b41f57fe48ffec579691940a1f1345658d1bc6eafe17d84ad06063",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7498771a373819a0498f715",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会毫无误差地\\n在目标时间内抵达终点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b74f0dcdad850bc338efc69b5d7509582c5f39c265b38b7f5bde043c991e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "293"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f66e7ea1eda2cb4ad8afccf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，黑森林蛋糕之类的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4557662d2e56a5de2a233acaed0104335f5b0d5997e21a9de31ecc864e0b86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "294"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9038494ed6044a5b92db34d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一早从伸展运动开始♪其他的例行公事\\n也全部都会分享到UG☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c124a4fc4b329552f65df883284af5404706d1d7856a572b3ef14a04b056d7d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "295"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5b8f71b7a61997484662a0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会注意别吃太多！虽然这么说，但唯独遇到\\n可爱甜点时，就会忍不住……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77a72cb962a24c1296465966ebaa562112504e910e5ff09cce889224f2db9094",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "296"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:440ffda95061774ca99537c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真机伶自己比较想被关注呢！\\n会展现出和平常不同的模样喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc32ff0f0f0740e3105eefc8c7f918b53d6c642b3e31fb6e17c5062e0a77547",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a16f345e6dd5dde6f9caad9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为公主会以高雅的品格、优雅的姿态——\\n远远超越其他对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0383a801661b50dd0e57460bdca4f8549d44060f957d05779c57bba3a04c1a34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:659edd030d1405a2f5a2bc7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "平日就要将美丽的举止铭记于心……\\n哎呀，有只小虫在飞呢。看我的喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acf9d0704cf777de1d98b0333220427dc395261ab84a659fe5af388333d4516",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6ed9068e8577c760af024f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个～内侧赛道……呃！\\n这个不能说出来～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "090559ceadb406f351e97461ba923bdcfc3c64990daad0c3ea8909dafb39712f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc56e2ad0f76d7b1577fe5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与并跑练习的伙伴一起开派对后，\\n隔天想早起会very hard！",
      "source_fingerprint": "717640bb6454cf09cc151902ef8a66175e7cc6dc88205067a1c65e7f12fe0fda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30dad04ab07246019c505b23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是用如公主般惹人怜爱的模样紧咬对手，\\n再用如小猫黏人般的执着穷追不舍吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24665f4ceee93b2de8a471bf87b16eae6ea0e0e55f03d9e3ad32f287c4fbfdf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f70ee0902d0e4d1a9850bc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是两回事。\\n我今天要专注在竞赛上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28322f524271850f05c414e4ff41f7727e1a8714c63aa1b4d05de3aade12d40e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:177df14e665b7853d479d554",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有许多比我还厉害的家伙。\\n──但我要做的事只有不畏惧地去挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c943bbf9e3cd77ef9632f033f122be4d573ee51fe973a3cb876e82723fddbf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d22d434e243b6a4b3b567a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我先说这发色是天生的。不仅显眼还容易\\n在竞赛中被盯上，相当麻烦呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "285fdfaf59e126947ec86ec4f49c3ad89bde2ded360b1f46d03543d14ad2eb44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6841c54b50f86b571b5ec2a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼！既然你都这样拜托了，我就说吧。\\n简单来说……就是爆进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a08d01360e1bd8376813d62b4eca946d21a04071566a9ed34c484892638967",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6fc608446c6e476d4e54d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起立！敬礼！我身为你们的班长，\\n会勇敢地跑下去！坐下──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "633d812f5d0bcfffc800010101b82af42e6b018f4fa2f58f4818177ddbbdf5cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8d5c27e488a78a8ecd19abb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是爆进！这样……好像是两个字？\\n不！要四个字就是爆进爆进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2903c10191502bdeeea9489cd24aba9ec04f840da1a7bbf1cfa3f376560ee393",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c434c9c0ab0af8172bf74164",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们一定要相信\\n我是比谁都更strong的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c14db036d4e45e99d5d1dbb8445605b4215bd7dc1ccad88453a130cd497966",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a1bb3381ac9935dd7926ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不只是打工而已喔。我做的每件事情\\n都是又hot又cool的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "336ad9a2f746e2bc5d4d0d2ab70b1a6a6b4d4e5717d426eb8f3275b730c49cb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a62fa73f11a214d3c2ffa75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Look・at・me!\\n──这就是答案啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b33a88f2805204b237dbe87c8caf1c1a2d63ebc47c1322333072855eb67ac73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46f4d8f98344949f8975ab9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过于紧绷反而容易受伤。\\n顺应情势，等待时机吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e495304fd6393372246bc743555f6fc14d9f30b7e059cf66e303de25a1f51ca9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd22300319c89c60dde3b432",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要用力咬紧对手！\\n……风风可不是开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19bdfa6e1147b63b0fa605c1333846e8af14559acc3f8ca5fe6c2f5200e140e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:812cec5e81658b50c18b4091",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吼唔──！\\n风风要把所有人都打得落花流水──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e02317bb60aec0c1fedbf9c94684aa0df3247ec5d550a736e245a0b712f16afc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a8b67fa058378081a1156d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是谁说的！唔唔唔……\\n风风绝对不要最后一名孤独过终点啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2e3ca3ead5012a40ca51c3617ea7212925ca3ba0b4184c507a9cc4a8ba5e2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c0a673f2c79a44b2daa07a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ふふーん、魔法よ、ま・ほ・う！　今日の\\nレースだってマジカルにひとっ飛びよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31b6b62b1a3cef91f2f35e09d4b06a4838868a07d7bf1af01604ddb91f9dbe33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:482d45fb034f7c650f683a98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "偉大なる魔女グランマよ。昔、魔法の箒のよ\\nうにレースを軽やかに駆け抜けたんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa843ef17fc5c84d3125dbd5da2057a3f0663172948c19dc5209dcddaba5d124",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4b752c0c7f0184eb7210f22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ふん、使い魔に恥ずかしいところは\\n見せないわ。期待しておいて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a703293f4f128df7193049427b06dee5cb161abaa40b9d4decebc25c364542",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb60c532eeba4dc9dea5d300",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会宠爱大家♪帮忙打扫洗衣服或\\n任～何事情，然后……呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddf67917e864124fcfd2acdb7886f49e0885ca5ea9067dba437f4e907d2a2e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d23d941f1624850d455626b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个……我担心记者小姐眼睛下面的\\n黑眼圈。你要好好休息才行喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f73924aa673eec3b365095237df282f81396d35eeb266bb8fa88ea5503a93e07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ba298ab146d27e5d84e24d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我做了饭团和大家一起吃。希望大家的努力和\\n成果都能像饭团的米饭一样黏在一起～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe3cd4e2f7dbd7ee85b268ddffd1c0f882b1e7c664833f71645937458c22fc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b11974f80952cbf5e7c5bcce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然，不论是舞蹈、歌唱还是粉丝互动都～\\n准备万全啰♪啊，你是问竞赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "193c6e63672d3a00fef1f9453d75c267201d4a48b39755f1f890d4c647512be4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:355b81308ec5130faf2ad12e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "越是了解日本文化，就越能体会其\\n深奥之处，所以实在不敢自称精通……",
      "source_fingerprint": "579f47a9911c735e57f9b4d3828c7ce359c3d082119e765fde87b70a5de99662",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8269d22d758e7252ca2f3471",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱演唱会歌曲就自然而然能放松啰☆\\n大力推荐这么做喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f417c3812bd5dcacac5535bc0e3e7a18ea40c68b3cb90f545c84b7c7a1d12962",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6ae98b549b1a37083da74b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃了水果三明治喔☆毕竟参加竞赛\\n需要能量，得吃甜的东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e96b68a7a05e85433016f8d72b10e795cb613bf8ebecb4e40febd66f9e078ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acf9c77cce318a153f6ff571",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "太好了，连我也能接受正式的采访……\\n啊，没事，那个，我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c51bdb2535879a961abfda51fbae78dbeb8eb331970bb542b6c30cb9f3aada",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1b80f91ff2d5dc48da0d82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，我很喜欢看书。\\n但比赛的发展我却完全猜不透呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd64bee890b2d7eb67d3b91feed5301c65b332c45f387728dd2851679e3daba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a6126998338d44958a6f227",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冒险故事。这次的比赛会成为怎样的冒险……\\n那个、我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e086324082453d9f37e2b56eb6d0dde330b3848fd6fac57fd6fe4d0ae58b79ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c283bb5ab1bede8559ed74c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我哪会去想那种事情啊？\\n反正，只要去做姑且就会赢吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8226295d1f76e136600586bf8c33e95e60463aca7a4bb64e56d3c224998758da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59411b7459f6d3be40ffcabd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如何？好看吧！话说我今天被超多人盯着看，\\n大概是因为弄得比平时还漂亮吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6a446b3092a3a8515ba5ea2bed79b0387f46c0aa927aedf589749c8d2b93501",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0202c7a02d7782e3c25d8a82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之就是要喝运动饮料。\\n名字叫开……开特……是什么来着啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb2699026ff8abcc608d8e35e6e16beb26b65ed73fbc575aa9b55fccff2cd887",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3fe7ec54cc2e4f38f8b3d52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道。\\n──所以才让人热血沸腾吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef91a32cc1e2b8d28639759583108f27f8a39ff3fb76cadb670e971c13ad2c8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76b7e61eadc9fdfe2ce8f84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在第三弯道附近展开攻势……应该吧。\\n所以呢，你信吗？还是说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1bfad7a66a4393189083a44f33275f6dbd1ba30a68372655af8c774c594aba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:181d35b26fe05f90cec691e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这我也不太清楚呢。看法应该是因人而异的。\\n要亲自确认看看吗～？呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d27c09417524591dae18e15769f395f2a8b606e94e1d73df32850264de49583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a64dce545be750b36d13f6d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待喔……\\n一起享受极限对战的乐趣吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf2a9f5aef0b00c01fb763494e64580e5cff0815cc0f33268f604ff98749a314",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb62f8ef85c2551393208a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔……谢谢。你真是个怪人耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "151be11ec470acab03a2c729f18c2a18a02274649923239275bfe62ae1203f0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41dbfe0936d1c762e7c08053",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也没有说很擅长啦……只是\\n有空的时候会玩……顶多这样吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc865a5849b2e590c4667a9de955e896fdc54b27866c896870a38672cf62c8a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679a78f8bac6c36996b3b655",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……不就是不认为自己很强吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab51380cc7f09568399b89c691f208e5f1047bf55a2f375c229fc045dba9de08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "333"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06aa4568baf8e9c746199c96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好、好的……！我虽然还只是小小的花蕾，\\n但会努力让自己漂亮地盛开的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3961228ebb4bde1bb7a496ac0b23b5ac84f5009feacbb63943ff56eaea15216f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7462574bd35069d1830238b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然跟其他人相比还不是那么可靠，\\n不过希望大家可以在一旁见证我的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9e1e8c2d00362a647839c7412e0eadc491212b6af554032d6ee443cbd7b477",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "335"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c918c91fb25352ea359255",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～是马铃薯炖肉和蛋包饭。\\n我可以只用平底锅就把蛋皮漂亮地卷起来♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4739d4ef3a5f9e3ad0d716d0e7bb14e22273d0ae3798343b916f61a15806a496",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "336"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4732912b0dce92ea1229cbb3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是什么！？在哪里可以吃到！？\\n我想吃看看致胜料理──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a44565b2beea7c6263a7ae5673605fc0cf8e88eb191ebc269658e6decccff4b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e58ec513f343c854a16901",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛不是「庙」喔！\\n它让人既兴奋又非常开心──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc2b1884909252ceef98aa7152701d1fc5c26625c8fabd3e7a3dc08b018af700",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0248c68863656463a04a4134",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做了很多喔！其中最有趣的，我想想──\\n跟米米做人力手推车体操！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8936686ace56503c0165ed6cf0030f14f989bd98293949990b554fc1f667789a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3070117a07c80e26d397f02a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是昨天发生的事，共享的西红柿酱\\n被换成了神鹰的超辣酱料……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a70b18cbeefb7b24d51a33ef7346f7f7acb297e6200a8a55c8d8cf6516f5d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e24c733ced048d2dd31b1275",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "堂堂正正一决胜负吧！\\n请多指教！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c353ac23d3e9b0470d86a6cc65effaf13afa1c44e988b2f3ced1114984183597",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e595bd0d044413c5cfd703c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "魔鬼应该是参考传说故事的吧。咦？不过\\n故事中的魔鬼，好像都是被讨伐的一方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b20d99fd1e2bbf17ce31fbb2364ec2ae1ff73401871a9f32132098e570ee088b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6538b3f008fd3834da35e351",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是我父亲。今天的比赛他一定也会看，\\n所以我绝对不能输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "667f6fe50b3cf10295e3950676770e6827b26ebe2aea8bffb307243c7cb18b57",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c7fb3b2438c0dfae215495",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "とうっ！　ヒーロー見参！　愛と平和と\\nにんじんのため、ビコーペガサス出走だ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "411277315c512fcd10ad0653749f41ea2c9f6e02794d9dcca04ef02e85e47f96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc205d45dda398be24adc96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "もちろん、キャロットマンだ！　いつだって\\nカッコいい、憧れのヒーローだぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d647aca9e52a815adcc0349f6325dd445e7b3474c43820e84cee47011ae473",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea78db0ab19bebde9063ad7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ああ、誰よりも速くゴールに駆けつける。\\nそれがヒーローの役目だからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a47038336361baecdc40358730cefb566bbc25eaba15837c005e9b3d2f8578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67dc41c150de0d3475ecc4bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯！我有确实减少补充水分了！\\n状态非常好哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "600a5557e0abe17f273408684620e4d58853b70a04c55633fceff4ef9d490a38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25feb74c3d78638b178f696f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在！与你的相遇，\\n就是一场美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9446398009cb58f46cc762ca4c4f8fd5a5e6f450755a9e5c2aeda48a7fbd730",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2022c36caaf1f14222ebd31b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是你还是我都很美丽☆\\n让我们跑出美丽的比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb8689a31a4e3f7c59bc01674cf613877abc861eca5b158bbb5a9c68b23d0ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "348"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:059415fc7d248c79be5527a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然！大、大、大、大、大、大……\\n大可放心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1784e2e2d0bc870fb5efef288a2c71e63fef7d3ca1a43abf5b1d443799264852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "349"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4a521e1e9f84e7a170eb07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把晚餐的胡萝卜切成星形吧。\\n一时兴起这样做后，意外地很受好评！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7631d9b7f8fe1d389743a55e14db4ab17af28beb61a64fb5767a801dceea5c4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0dc09a60446a9eb23e850b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔唔……看到了！\\n如果我赢的话就是大吉！交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af4a66e30a3ea205f287848942b8faf1b43058a85dc5269447f8c62cb9b3f1f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "350"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dffa7973975f8c3b65a5c24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会降临吗？不，是确定会降临！因为我睡觉前\\n有拍3下枕头并默念「Shiraoki大人」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d48c1ad44483af1115bca0db35e60d0a549a43026bac039bb979ede6bdfb87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "351"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
